<GuideLayout
  title="How to Move GDLauncher's Data to Another Drive"
  description="Change GDLauncher's runtime path to move all instances, assets, libraries, and the launcher database to a different drive or folder, with migration handled automatically."
  keywords="move gdlauncher data, change runtime path, move minecraft instances drive, gdlauncher migration, free up ssd space"
  lastUpdated="May 2026"
  howTo={{
